text = "Open4All is a company specialized in e-helpers.
The goal of the organization is to empower users, help them solve menial tasks and give them freedom to do things they love.

It was founded in 1999 as a nonprofit. It's value has been increasing exponentially, creating widespread interest in the research and development of larger e-centers, better e-helpers and soon the awaited e-worker.

Its founders are"
